    {
      "partOfSpeech": "Adjective",
      "language": "English",
      "definitions": [
        {
          "definition": "<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt309\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> <i>In the form</i> <b>be ghost</b>: not <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/present#Adjective\" title=\"present\">present</a> or <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/involved#Adjective\" title=\"involved\">involved</a>; <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/absent#Adjective\" title=\"absent\">absent</a>, <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/gone#Adjective\" title=\"gone\">gone</a>."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "partOfSpeech": "Verb",
      "language": "English",
      "definitions": [
        {
          "definition": "<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt314\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span>\n<ol><li><span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt315\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span>\n<ol><li>Of a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/disembodied#Adjective\" title=\"disembodied\">disembodied</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/soul#Noun\" title=\"soul\">soul</a>: to appear (somewhere or to someone) in the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/form#Noun\" title=\"form\">form</a> of an <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/apparition\" title=\"apparition\">apparition</a>; to <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/haunt#Verb\" title=\"haunt\">haunt</a>.\n</li>\n<li>To <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/imbue\" title=\"imbue\">imbue</a> (something) with a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/ghostlike\" title=\"ghostlike\">ghost-like</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/effect#Noun\" title=\"effect\">effect</a> or <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/hue\" title=\"hue\">hue</a>.\n</li></ol></li>\n<li><span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt318\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span>\n<ol><li>To <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/continuously\" title=\"continuously\">continuously</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/cause#Verb\" title=\"cause\">cause</a> (someone or something) <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/trouble#Verb\" title=\"trouble\">trouble</a>; specifically, to continuously be in the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/thought#Noun\" title=\"thought\">thoughts</a> of (someone) in a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/disturbing#Adjective\" title=\"disturbing\">disturbing</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/manner#Noun\" title=\"manner\">manner</a>; to <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/perturb\" title=\"perturb\">perturb</a>, to <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/trouble#Verb\" title=\"trouble\">trouble</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt319\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> To <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/kill#Verb\" title=\"kill\">kill</a> (someone).\n</li>\n<li><span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt324\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span>\n<ol><li><span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt325\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> To <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/gray_out\" title=\"gray out\">gray out</a> (a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/visual#Adjective\" title=\"visual\">visual</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/element#Noun\" title=\"element\">element</a>) to <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/indicate\" title=\"indicate\">indicate</a> that it is <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/unavailable#Adjective\" title=\"unavailable\">unavailable</a>.\n</li>\n<li><span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt327\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> To <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/forcibly\" title=\"forcibly\">forcibly</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/disconnect#Verb\" title=\"disconnect\">disconnect</a> (an <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/IRC\" title=\"IRC\">IRC</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/user\" title=\"user\">user</a>) who is <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/use#Verb\" title=\"use\">using</a> one's <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/reserved#Adjective\" title=\"reserved\">reserved</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/nickname#Noun\" title=\"nickname\">nickname</a>.\n</li></ol></li>\n<li><span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt329\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> To <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/stop#Verb\" title=\"stop\">stop</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/communicate#Verb\" title=\"communicate\">communicating</a> with (someone) on <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/social_media\" title=\"social media\">social media</a>, through <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/text_message\" title=\"text message\">text messages</a>, etc., without <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/explanation\" title=\"explanation\">explanation</a>, especially as a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" 